# AoC 2020 Day 1 Part 1 — find the two entries that sum to 2020, multiply them.
# The All Pairs sum-to-2020 lambda is a request; with optimization on, the
# compiler lowers it to an O(n) hash-set scan (see --explain).
Cursed Energy: input.txt
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Channeled Energy: Convert List to Integers
Domain Expansion: All Pairs
    Mode: First
    Using: (a, b) -> a + b = 2020
Maximum Technique: Product
Reveal: stdout
